{"id": "EUVD-2026-95420", "enisaUuid": "302e0508-25e4-36c9-a8fe-a9c488ec6c8a", "description": "On Windows, when the target of Root.Mkdir or Root.MkdirAll is a junction pointing to an empty location, the operation can create a directory at the junction target even when that target is located outside the root. This only applies to operations where the last path component is a junction (path/to/junction, but not path/junction/target).", "datePublished": "2026-10-08T22:53:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-09T15:36:01", "baseScore": 9.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://go.dev/cl/847305", "https://go.dev/issue/81739", "https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/U2fTuyDJznI", "https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-6604"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-56857", "GHSA-c3q7-m35p-9qq7"], "assigner": "Go", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3f3495c9-1961-3379-858d-79de615eef9e", "product": {"name": "internal/syscall/windows", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "1.27.0-0 <1.27.2"}, {"id": "5871ae32-4402-33d7-bc50-323106e5f261", "product": {"name": "internal/syscall/windows", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.26.9"}, {"id": "982bf9b6-24b2-3461-a832-c1287a4a3830", "product": {"name": "os", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.26.9"}, {"id": "cf98fe7f-4729-3a36-ba67-49bb1172ac8b", "product": {"name": "os", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "1.27.0-0 <1.27.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ed385922-5779-35e0-b694-ae4985790e71", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}], "isExploited": false}